    {"type":"text","id":"cc_h","x":1115,"y":215,"width":350,"height":28,"text":"Claude Code","originalText":"Claude Code","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500003,"version":1,"versionNonce":500004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"cc_sub","x":1115,"y":247,"width":350,"height":22,"text":"secondary A2UI surface (via MCP plugin); primary is the Electron diary view","originalText":"secondary A2UI surface (via MCP plugin); primary is the Electron diary view","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500005,"version":1,"versionNonce":500006,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"cc_body","x":1115,"y":280,"width":350,"height":175,"text":"1. Invokes /digest → digest_run\n    Renders returned JSON as A2UI inline.\n2. Component actions (Send / Accept / Apply):\n    executes via its own tools\n    (Gmail send, Calendar accept, file edit, ...)\n    then calls diary_act to confirm completion.\n3. Principal types a comment + submits:\n    diary_add_comment(component_id, text).\n4. Principal types a bottom note + submits:\n    diary_add_note(text).\n\nDigest agent does NOT execute on the world.\nClaude Code (or the principal) does.","originalText":"1. Invokes /digest → digest_run\n    Renders returned JSON as A2UI inline.\n2. Component actions (Send / Accept / Apply):\n    executes via its own tools\n    (Gmail send, Calendar accept, file edit, ...)\n    then calls diary_act to confirm completion.\n3. Principal types a comment + submits:\n    diary_add_comment(component_id, text).\n4. Principal types a bottom note + submits:\n    diary_add_note(text).\n\nDigest agent does NOT execute on the world.\nClaude Code (or the principal) does.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500007,"version":1,"versionNonce":500008,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.45},
